able only","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"while the device is unlocked — and kept out of backups by default,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"since a credential is useless without its holder key, which is in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"this device’s Secure Enclave and can’t be restored elsewhere.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/FileCredentialStore","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/Wallet":{"title":"Wallet","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/wallet","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Wallet"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A holder’s wallet: OID4VCgo’s walletflow over the app’s key store,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"credential store and Wallet Provider.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/Wallet","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/tlsPins":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"tlsPins","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/tlspins","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/WalletConfiguration\/tlsPins","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Pins hosts’ certificates for the wallet’s own HTTPS requests:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"host → base64 SHA-256 digests of a certificate’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"SubjectPublicKeyInfo, one of which a certificate in the verified"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"chain must have, or the request fails as "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"tlsPin"},{"type":"text","text":" before anything"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"is sent. A host is a name, or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"*."},{"type":"text","text":" and one, matching any name a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"label below it; not an IP address. Pins add to certificate"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"verification, never replace it: pin a CA’s key, so a leaf renewal"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"doesn’t break the app, and keep a backup pin. They cover the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"requests the SDK makes (issuers, Authorization Servers,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Verifiers, status lists), not the app’s own, such as to its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Wallet Provider: pin that client yourself."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tlsPins"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":" : ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":"]]"}]},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/InMemoryCredentialStore":{"title":"InMemoryCredentialStore","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"class"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"InMemoryCredentialStore"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/inmemorycredentialstore","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"InMemoryCredentialStore"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A credential store in memory, for tests and development.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet\/documentation\/OID4VCWallet\/InMemoryCredentialStore","kind":"symbol"},"doc://oid4vcwallet.OID4VCWallet/documentation/OID4VCWallet/WalletConfiguration/issuerRoots":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/issuerroots","fragments